{'symbol': 'WBA', 'date': '2021-06-22 09:03:00', 'title': 'INDIVIDUALS GETTING COVID-19 VACCINES AT WALGREENS TO RECEIVE $25 IN WALGREENS CASH REWARDS', 'text': 'DEERFIELD, ILL.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--BEGINNING TODAY, CUSTOMERS GETTING A COVID-19 VACCINATION AT WALGREENS WILL RECEIVE $25 IN WALGREENS CASH REWARDS.* THE WALGREENS CASH REWARDS WILL BE AVAILABLE IMMEDIATELY FOLLOWING THE VACCINATION FOR THOSE WHO HAVE MYWALGREENS ACCOUNTS. INDIVIDUALS WITHOUT A MYWALGREENS ACCOUNT CAN OPT TO RECEIVE A $25 WALGREENS GIFT CARD FOLLOWING VACCINATION AT WALGREENS.† PARENTS OR GUARDIANS OF ELIGIBLE ADOLESCENTS AGES 12-15 WHO GET THE VACCINE WILL ALSO BE ELIGIBLE TO'}